ery worker has a story to tell.Today, I'm excited to share Demo 2.0, featuring a completely redesigned interface and a more polished mining experience.What's new?The Office of the SteigerThe interface has been redesigned around the idea of an old mining","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:16:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690732","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112960-1846018067926289","game_id":"steam-5112960","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is Now Available!","summary":"The demo for Scherbenmark: The Old Mine is now available on Steam.Take your first steps underground, take control of the old mine, and see how deep you can push your operation.The demo is also our first major step toward Steam Next Fest, October 19–26.If you give it a try, I’d love to hear your feedback. Every report, suggestion and strange thing you encounter underground helps shape the game.Play the demo now and wishlist Scherbenmark: The Old Mine if you’d like to follow its development.See yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T14:12:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926289","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5112960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5112960":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5112960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z"},"5113370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:18Z"